# Appendix: MITRE ATT&amp;CK Techniques # {#mitre-attack-techniques}

The [MITRE ATT&amp;CK Enterprise techniques](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/enterprise/) can be used as prompts when analyzing attacks involving a web browser. The following list is non-exhaustive and is grouped by level for this document. Inclusion does not mean that a technique applies to every browser architecture or scenario.

